    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The white mask of the Nightar warrior should be observed very carefully. There are many reasons to this, the most visible being this: the more plain the mask, the more skilled the warrior. The highest ranked among their kind wear one that is plain white, with only narrow slits for eyes.",
    "value": "夜族战士所佩戴的白色面具需细致观察。其背后有多重含义，最显著者为：面具越朴素，战士技艺越高超。族中最高阶者佩戴纯白无饰之面，仅留细窄眼缝。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The lower the rank of the warrior, the more vibrant the mask will become. Unblooded warriors (those with no battlefield experience) instead wear a black mask adorned with a singular blue stripe in the center. Their low rank also means they serve as envoys to the galaxy at large.",
    "value": "战士等级越低，面具色彩越显鲜明。未染血之战士（即无战场经验者）佩戴黑色面具，中央饰有一道蓝纹。因其阶位较低，常被遣为使者，往来于广袤星系之间。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Those among the top 200 warriors do not communicate with anyone that is not of their race. Ever. Their code forbids any form of verbal congress outside of their people, no matter the reason. They will, however, communicate with gestures using head, limbs and digits.",
    "value": "前两百名勇士绝不与外族交谈，此乃铁律。其准则严禁任何形式的对外言语交流，无论缘由为何。然这些勇士仍可借头部、四肢及手指动作进行手势沟通。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "Low-ranked warriors are permitted to socialize with whom they please, though doing so with too much frequency will earn them the title of Vilmaehkt. This is a grave insult, meaning Red-Blood. On their world, due to low oxygen, their blood is blue. A Vilmaehkt is a 'filthy outsider', unworthy.",
    "value": "低阶战士虽可自由择交，然若与外族过从甚密，则会被冠以“维尔梅克特”之称。此名实为奇耻，意为“赤血者”。因其母星氧气稀薄，夜族人血液本呈蓝色，“赤血者”遂指“污秽之外来者”，喻其为不肖族人。"
